<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR" class="scroll-smooth">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <link rel="icon" href="/images/logo/icon-ionos.png?v=2" type="image/png">
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap"
        rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>

<body class="bg-gray-50 text-gray-800 font-[Inter]">

  <!-- NAVBAR -->
  <%- include('partials/header.ejs') %>


  <main>

   <!--*******************************************************HERO/CAPA*******************************************************-->
    <!-- HERO -->
<section class="relative overflow-hidden h-screen flex items-center bg-gradient-to-br from-[#005A72] via-[#007A8F] to-[#07C0D4]">

  <!-- Ondas -->
  <div class="absolute -top-56 -left-40 w-[650px] h-[650px] rounded-full border border-white/10"></div>
  <div class="absolute -top-40 -left-20 w-[450px] h-[450px] rounded-full border border-white/10"></div>

  <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-[500px] h-[500px] rounded-full bg-white/5"></div>
  <div class="absolute top-32 right-32 w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-white/20"></div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-24 left-1/2 w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-white/30"></div>

  <div class="relative container mx-auto px-6 text-center">

    <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-bold text-white">
      <a class="notranslate"
  translate="no">Ionos </a>Dessalinização
    </h1>

    

    <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-xl md:text-2xl text-white/90 leading-9">
      Somos uma startup focada no desenvolvimento de sistemas de dessalinização para a produção de água de qualidade de forma eficiente e sustentável
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10">
      <a href="#technology"
        class="inline-block bg-white text-[#005A72] px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-semibold hover:bg-gray-100 transition">
        Conheça nossa tecnologia
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>

</section>

<!---------------------------------------------------HERO/CAPA------------------------------------------------------------------------>


<!--*******************************************************A TECNOLOGIA*******************************************************-->

<section id="technology" class="relative py-24 overflow-hidden bg-gray-50">

  <!-- Elementos decorativos -->
  <div class="absolute -top-32 -right-32 w-96 h-96 bg-cyan-100 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-40"></div>
  <div class="absolute -bottom-32 -left-32 w-96 h-96 bg-blue-100 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-40"></div>

  <div class="relative container mx-auto px-6">

    <!-- Cabeçalho -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">

      <p class="text-cyan-600 font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-sm mb-3">
        Nossa tecnologia
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-[#0D0D0D]">
        A Tecnologia
      </h2>

      <div class="w-20 h-1 bg-[#07C0D4] rounded-full mx-auto mt-5"></div>

      <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold text-[#007A8F] mt-8">
        Deionização Capacitiva (CDI)
      </h3>

    </div>


    <!-- Cards -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 max-w-6xl mx-auto">


      <!-- CARD 1 -->
      <div class="group bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-lg
                  border border-gray-100
                  hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-2xl
                  transition-all duration-300">

        <div class="w-16 h-16 flex items-center justify-center
                    rounded-2xl bg-cyan-50 text-[#007A8F]
                    group-hover:bg-[#007A8F]
                    group-hover:text-white
                    transition-all duration-300 mb-6">

          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
               fill="none"
               viewBox="0 0 24 24"
               stroke-width="1.5"
               stroke="currentColor"
               class="w-8 h-8">

            <path stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  d="m3.75 13.5 10.5-11.25L12 10.5h8.25L9.75 21.75 12 13.5H3.75Z" />

          </svg>

        </div>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#0D0D0D] mb-4">
          A Deionização Capacitiva
        </h3>

        <p class="text-[#5F5F5F] leading-7">
          A CDI consome menos energia que a osmose reversa
          (tecnologia mais utilizada) para a dessalinização
          de águas salobras.
        </p>

      </div>


      <!-- CARD 2 -->
      <div class="group bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-lg
                  border border-gray-100
                  hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-2xl
                  transition-all duration-300">

        <div class="w-16 h-16 flex items-center justify-center
                    rounded-2xl bg-cyan-50 text-[#007A8F]
                    group-hover:bg-[#007A8F]
                    group-hover:text-white
                    transition-all duration-300 mb-6">

          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
               fill="none"
               viewBox="0 0 24 24"
               stroke-width="1.5"
               stroke="currentColor"
               class="w-8 h-8">

            <path stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  d="M19.5 14.25v-2.625a3.375 3.375 0 0 0-3.375-3.375h-1.5A1.125 1.125 0 0 1 13.5 7.125v-1.5a3.375 3.375 0 0 0-3.375-3.375H8.25m5.231 13.481L15 17.25m-4.5-1.5 5.231 5.231m0 0L21 21m-6-6-3.769-3.769m0 0L8.25 7.5l-3.769 3.769m3.769 3.769 3.769 3.769M12 21l-3.769-3.769" />

          </svg>

        </div>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#0D0D0D] mb-4">
          Monitoramento Remoto
        </h3>

        <p class="text-[#5F5F5F] leading-7">
          Acompanhamos o desempenho do sistema em tempo real,
          garantindo manutenção preditiva, antecipando as falhas
          e mantendo a continuidade do processo.
        </p>

      </div>


      <!-- CARD 3 -->
      <div class="group bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-lg
                  border border-gray-100
                  hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-2xl
                  transition-all duration-300">

        <div class="w-16 h-16 flex items-center justify-center
                    rounded-2xl bg-cyan-50 text-[#007A8F]
                    group-hover:bg-[#007A8F]
                    group-hover:text-white
                    transition-all duration-300 mb-6">

          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
               fill="none"
               viewBox="0 0 24 24"
               stroke-width="1.5"
               stroke="currentColor"
               class="w-8 h-8">

            <path stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  d="M14.25 9.75 16.5 12l-2.25 2.25m-4.5 0L7.5 12l2.25-2.25M6 20.25h12A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 20.25 18V5.75A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 18 3.5H6A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 3.75 5.75v12.5A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 6 20.25Z" />

          </svg>

        </div>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#0D0D0D] mb-4">
          Controle Inteligente
        </h3>

        <p class="text-[#5F5F5F] leading-7">
          Nossos sistemas usam sensores e algoritmos para otimizar
          o ciclo de dessalinização em tempo real, maximizando a
          eficiência e a vida útil dos materias.
        </p>

      </div>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>

<!---------------------------------------------------A TECNOLOGIA------------------------------------------------------------------------>





<!--*******************************************************CONQUISTAS*******************************************************-->

<section class="relative py-24 overflow-hidden bg-white">

  <!-- Elementos decorativos -->
  <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-72 h-72 bg-cyan-50 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-60"></div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-80 h-80 bg-blue-50 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-60"></div>

  <div class="relative container mx-auto px-6">

    <!-- Cabeçalho -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">

      <p class="text-cyan-600 font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-sm mb-3">
        Nossa trajetória
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-[#0D0D0D]">
        Nossas Conquistas
      </h2>

      <div class="w-20 h-1 bg-[#07C0D4] rounded-full mx-auto mt-5"></div>

      <p class="text-[#5F5F5F] mt-6 leading-7">
        Estamos orgulhosos de sermos reconhecidos em programas de inovação e aceleração que validam nosso impacto e tecnologia.
      </p>

    </div>


    <!-- Cards -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8
                max-w-6xl mx-auto">


      <!-- CARD 1 -->
      <div class="relative bg-gradient-to-br from-[#007A8F] to-[#005F70]
                  text-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-xl
                  hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-2xl
                  transition-all duration-300">

        <span class="absolute top-5 right-5
                     bg-[#07C0D4] text-[#0D0D0D]
                     text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1
                     rounded-full uppercase tracking-wide">
          Mais Recente
        </span>

        <div class="w-14 h-14 flex items-center justify-center
                    rounded-xl bg-white/10 mb-6">

          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
               fill="none"
               viewBox="0 0 24 24"
               stroke-width="1.5"
               stroke="currentColor"
               class="w-8 h-8">

            <path stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  d="M16.5 18.75h-9m9 0a3 3 0 0 1 3 3h-15a3 3 0 0 1 3-3m9 0v-3.375c0-.621-.503-1.125-1.125-1.125h-6.75c-.621 0-1.125.504-1.125 1.125V18.75m9 0h-9m9 0h-9m0 0H5.625M18.375 18.75h.008v.008h-.008v-.008Z" />

          </svg>

        </div>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">
          Incubação no Partec - UFC
        </h3>

        <p class="text-white/85 text-sm leading-7">
          Em <strong>2025</strong>, fomos
          <strong>aprovados no processo de incubação do Partec</strong>,
          o Parque Tecnológico da UFC. Este marco reforça nosso
          compromisso com o desenvolvimento tecnológico e a inovação sustentável.
        </p>

      </div>


      <!-- CARD 2 -->
      <div class="group bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8
                  border border-gray-100 shadow-lg
                  hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-xl
                  transition-all duration-300">

        <div class="w-14 h-14 flex items-center justify-center
                    rounded-xl bg-cyan-50 text-[#007A8F]
                    group-hover:bg-[#007A8F]
                    group-hover:text-white
                    transition-all duration-300 mb-6">

          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
               fill="none"
               viewBox="0 0 24 24"
               stroke-width="1.5"
               stroke="currentColor"
               class="w-8 h-8">

            <path stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  d="M16.862 4.487l1.687-1.688a1.875 1.875 0 1 1 2.652 2.652L10.582 16.07a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-1.897 1.13L6 18l.8-2.685a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 1.13-1.897l8.932-8.931Zm0 0L19.5 7.125M18 14v4.75A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 15.75 21H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 3 18.75V8.25A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 5.25 6H10" />

          </svg>

        </div>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-[#0D0D0D]">
          Empreende UFC & Corredores Digitais
        </h3>

        <p class="text-[#5F5F5F] text-sm leading-7">
          Em <strong>2025</strong>, conquistamos o
          <strong>1º lugar no Demoday</strong> da fase
          <strong>BORA CRIAR</strong> do programa Empreende UFC,
          em parceria com os Corredores Digitais. Essa conquista
          destaca nosso potencial de inovação e impacto tecnológico.
        </p>

      </div>


      <!-- CARD 3 -->
      <div class="group bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8
                  border border-gray-100 shadow-lg
                  hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-xl
                  transition-all duration-300">

        <div class="w-14 h-14 flex items-center justify-center
                    rounded-xl bg-cyan-50 text-[#007A8F]
                    group-hover:bg-[#007A8F]
                    group-hover:text-white
                    transition-all duration-300 mb-6">

          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
               fill="none"
               viewBox="0 0 24 24"
               stroke-width="1.5"
               stroke="currentColor"
               class="w-8 h-8">

            <path stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  d="M16.862 4.487l1.687-1.688a1.875 1.875 0 1 1 2.652 2.652L10.582 16.07a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-1.897 1.13L6 18l.8-2.685a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 1.13-1.897l8.932-8.931Zm0 0L19.5 7.125M18 14v4.75A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 15.75 21H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 3 18.75V8.25A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 5.25 6H10" />

          </svg>

        </div>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-[#0D0D0D]">
          Catalisa ICT (SEBRAE)
        </h3>

        <p class="text-[#5F5F5F] text-sm leading-7">
          Projeto aprovado em <strong>2025</strong> na 1ª fase
          do programa Catalisa ICT, promovido pelo SEBRAE.
        </p>

      </div>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>


<!---------------------------------------------------CONQUISTAS------------------------------------------------------------------------>


  </main>


  <!-- FOOTER -->
  <%- include('partials/footer.ejs') %>


  <!-- SCRIPTS -->
  <%- include('partials/scripts.ejs') %>

</body>
</html>

